    "title": "Dalton Mound Melee: 8U Softball Coach Cuffed After Viral Brawl - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ray Bianchi ,\n12 hours ago An 8U youth softball game in Dalton, Georgia, turned into a mound-side brawl, and now a coach is facing a criminal charge after video of the fight rocketed across social media. The clip shows adults from the Wreckers and an opposing GA Fury Platinum Harris team in a heated confrontation at the pitcher’s mound while eight-year-old players watch from the dugout. The fallout has already brought criminal charges and swift sanctions from youth softball organizers. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
